# Redaction keys map placeholders back to the real network they were measured
# on. bluos-probe.py writes DO-NOT-SHARE-key-<stamp>.json; lsdp-static writes
# whatever --key names. Neither belongs in the repository, so neither can be
# committed by accident.
DO-NOT-SHARE-*
*.key

# python bytecode from importing bluos-probe.py
__pycache__/
